--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pretrained vision weights
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The anomaly backbone is derived from torchvision ImageNet-pretrained
ResNet-18 weights.  The torchvision source licence is BSD-3-Clause, but that
code licence does not settle the terms for the downloaded weights or the
ImageNet-derived material.  The archived ImageNet Terms of Access restrict the
database to non-commercial research and educational use.  Confirm authoritative
terms covering the exact weight files before redistribution or commercial
deployment.  The exact local backbone state is stored inside each profile
artifact and is hash-locked by configs/artifacts.json.

The Kolektor U-Net encoder is initialised from the same torchvision ResNet-18
weights and then trained on KolektorSDD.  The steel detector is initialised
from the Ultralytics YOLO COCO checkpoint and then trained on NEU-DET.

